{"results":[{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/fortune-avirahi","title":"Fortune Avirahi In Borivali West | Buy 3 & 4 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21)\n\n>\n\nAvirahi Group\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/avirahi-group-fortune-avirahi-elevation-1689053384.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/avirahi-group-fortune-avirahi-elevation-1689053396.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/avirahi-group-fortune-avirahi-bedroom-1675316669.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/avirahi-group-fortune-avirahi-elevation-1689053384.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/avirahi-group-fortune-avirahi-elevation-1689053396.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/141122065355-images-31.webp)\n\n# Fortune Avirahi\n\nBhatt Chawl,F.P, 75, Jambli Galli, Gully, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹4 Cr - 4.88 Cr\n\n₹4 Cr - 4.88 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nFortune Avirahi Wing A is a residential project by Fortune Constructions located at Borivali West in Mumbai. The key amenities of the project include . Owing to its location, facilities such as schools, hospitals, ATMs, and markets are available at a close distance from Fortune Avirahi Wing A. An extensive network of public transports in the close vicinity makes the project accessible.\n\nConfiguration\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2022\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹33,557/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n1192 - 1453 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Three open-side homes.\n* For a comfortable lifestyle, there is a pool, a tree plantation, and a play area for kids.\n\n* Access to important landmarks.\n* Schools, hospitals, educational institutions, eateries, banks, and movie theatres are all conveniently located.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nFortune Avirahi in Borivali West generally receives positive feedback for its strategic location and construction quality. Residents and visitors frequently mention its proximity to Borivali Railway Station and the Metro, making it highly accessible. The project is noted for being a premium, mixed-use development that combines luxury residential units with commercial spaces. While the ambiance and internal specifications are praised, some users point out the high density of the surrounding area and typical suburban traffic challenges.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nPrime Connectivity\n\nSituated within walking distance of Borivali Railway Station and close to the Western Express Highway and Link Road.\n\nQuality Construction\n\nRecognized for premium finishing, Vastu-compliant designs, and modern amenities like a high-tech gym and grand entrance lobby.\n\nProximity to Essentials\n\nConvenient access to reputable schools, hospitals, markets, and the Sanjay Gandhi National Park.\n\nMixed-Use Convenience\n\nIntegration of commercial shops and offices provides on-site facilities for residents and business owners.\n\nAdvanced Features\n\nEquipped with video door phones, high-speed elevators, and power backup for common areas.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nCongested Surroundings\n\nLocated in a busy part of Borivali West (Jambli Gully), which can lead to significant noise and traffic during peak hours.\n\nPricing\n\nProperty rates and rentals are considered high, even for the locality, making it less accessible for budget-conscious buyers.\n\nLimited Open Space\n\nAs a single-tower development on a compact plot, there is restricted space for large gardens or expansive outdoor play areas.\n\nParking Density\n\nSome feedback suggests that managing visitor parking can be challenging due to the commercial-residential mix.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nIdeal for Professionals: A top choice for those prioritizing a short commute to the station and seeking a \"walk-to-work\" lifestyle.\n\nPremium Investment: Well-suited for buyers looking for a luxury 3 or 4 BHK configuration with high-end internal specifications.\n\nUrban Trade-off: Best for those who value central urban convenience over quiet, sprawling green townships.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n3 BHK\n\n4 BHK\n\n* ## 1192 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n3 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹4 Cr\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/avirahi-group-fortune-avirahi-3-bhk-bedroom-1675317125.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![hospital-primary](/assets/icons/hospital-primary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![school-secondary](/assets/icons/school-secondary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nPurohit Hospital\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nProsper Multispeciality Hospital\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nApex Hospitals Borivali\n\n0.6 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nApex Superspeciality Hospitals - Best Hospital In Borivali\n\n0.7 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nLotus Superspeciality Hospital\n\n0.7 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nShree Ganesha Hospital - Best Hospital In Borivali West | Best Icu | Emergency Care | Gall Bladder | Kidney Stone Surgery\n\n0.8 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹4,17,990per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹5,01,58,793\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nFortune Avirahiis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800004496](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800004496)\n\nFortune Avirahi\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Fortune Avirahi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Fortune Avirahi is 30 Dec 2022\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Fortune Avirahi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Fortune Avirahi is 1192 - 1453 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Fortune Avirahi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Fortune Avirahi is ₹4 Cr - 4.88 Cr\n\n### Where is Fortune Avirahi located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nFortune Avirahi is located at Bhatt Chawl,F.P, 75, Jambli Galli, Gully, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092.\n\n### What configurations are available in Fortune Avirahi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nFortune Avirahi has 3 BHK, 4 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Fortune Avirahi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Fortune Avirahi is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Fortune Avirahi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Senior citizen Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Fortune Avirahi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Fortune Avirahi is Avirahi Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Fortune Avirahi:Avirahi Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/141122065355-images-31.webp)\n\n## Avirahi Group\n\nAt Avirahi Group, we have been transforming the real estate landscape with landmark developments that embody quality, trust & innovation. With decades of experience, we specialize in delivering residential & commercial projects that combine modern architecture, superior construction standards & thoughtful planning. Our mission is to create spaces that enhance lifestyles & provide exceptional value to homebuyers & investors. Every project is designed with a focus on sustainability, functionality & aesthetics, ensuring long-term satisfaction for our customers. We strive to set new benchmarks in urban living by developing vibrant communities that reflect our passion for excellence & our dedication to shaping a better tomorrow.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/konark-developer-konark-32-west-view-elevation-1779782095.webp)\n\n![Konark 32 West View](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150923041604-newproject-3.webp)\n\nKonark 32 West View\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.35 Cr - 7.71 Cr\n\n2, 3, 4.5 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dotom-realty-dotom-vue-elevation-1747896338.jpg)\n\n![Dotom Vue](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/111125030803-dotommvlogo.webp)\n\nDotom Vue\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹95 L - 1.5 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dgs-group-builders-dgs-sheetal-shashank-elevation-1754035295.jpg)\n\n![DGS Sheetal Shashank](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/230822105140-newproject-2022-08-23t105040950.png)\n\nDGS Sheetal Shashank\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.05 Cr - 1.77 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/paradig