enience, leading to a perfect life. Modernization has genuinely reformed the designing of buildings and the architecture industry.  \n  \nFortune Avirahi is a live example of how such transformations are done to make a sustainable living with class. The structures are designed in such a way as to cope with disaster. Fortune Avirahi was built by Fortune Constructions to bring a change in real estate, and this property has become one of the finest properties as per current standards.  \n  \nApart from its unique design, the property has high-end amenities and high-tech facilities to make living easy here. Surrounded by many landmark places such as Jain Temple, Moksh Plazza, Ragda Municipal School, Dwarka Hotel, and many such places at a walkable distance from the property makes, your evening and accommodation are easy.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Fortune Avirahi Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Fortune Avirahi in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 454776](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1138/BHK_Configuration/1138_1678021397_ff21185f706893dcd6a7f15e8a5a8c00.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n816 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n3.1 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Fortune Avirahi in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 454777](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1138/BHK_Configuration/1138_1678021397_302fce41d5beb3bb99730cb219ba6cda.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1027 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n3.9 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Fortune Avirahi in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 454778](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1138/BHK_Configuration/1138_1678021397_bf15e2462128ad71643e3372b601e820.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1192 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n4.52 Cr\n\n![4 BHK Flat in Fortune Avirahi in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 454779](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1138/BHK_Configuration/1138_1678021397_ee61448ee3082a886ef8c4e0ebbeddde.webp)\n\n4 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1453 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n5.52 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Fortune Avirahi in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 28197](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1138/Floor%20Plan/1138_1678021397_25f83eb29cd2b87c62d1b146fae26464.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Fortune Avirahi Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Good Ventilation.\n* Extravagant Entrance Lobby.\n* Ideal Location.\n* Ample Parking Space.\n* Serene Environment.\n* Top Notch Amenities.\n\n## Amenities Fortune Avirahi Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Lift\n* Power Back Up\n* Solar Power\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* Parking and transportation\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Community Club\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Vaastu-Compliant Designs\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* 24/7 Security\n\n* Themed Landscape Garden\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Smart switches\n* HDMI Port\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Air-conditioned apartments\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Water Purifier\n* Plaster\n* Dado Tiles\n\n## Walkthrough video Fortune Avirahi Borivali West\n\n## Google Map Location of Fortune Avirahi Borivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Borivali West](/location-review/mumbai/borivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Borivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Borivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nFortune Avirahi is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800004496](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800004496)\n\nProject: Fortune Avirahi\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Fortune Avirahi Borivali West\n\n---\n\n* St Rock’s College\n* Gokhale College\n* Everest College\n* Jaya International School\n\n* Ashwini Ayurvedic Hopsital\n* Apex Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospital\n* Sailee Hospital\n\n* Growel 101 Mall\n* Zoom Plaza mall\n* Moksh Plaza\n* Pantaloons Store\n\n* Tandoor Chai\n* Hooch Gourmet Bar Beats\n* Double Door Lounge\n* The Secret Dessert\n\n![Fortune Constructions](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/708_1678040177_fortune-logo.webp)\n\n## [Fortune Constructions](/mumbai/sale/builder/fortune-constructions-708)\n\nOngoing Projects: 1\n\nTotal Projects: 1\n\n---\n\nAdding some tremendous residential and commercial masterpieces to the horizon of Mumbai, Avirahi, with its presence and hard work, imbibed solid professional values in their developments. For over two decades, the organization has been driven by the vision of delivering awe-struck excellency and customer-centricity. With such a vast and exemplary experience, Avirahi thrives on planning, constructing and delivering outstanding habitats for a peaceful and serene living.  \n  \nAfter accomplishing a target of 15000+ happy customers with their impeccable developments, Avirahi's upcoming projects, Avirahi Elegance, Avirahi Arcade and Avirahi Homes, will flatter the homebuyers with their meticulous planning and allures investors and stakeholders with unimaginable construction.  \n  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Fortune Constructions](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/fortune-constructions-708)\n\n## FAQ's about Fortune Avirahi Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Borivali West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Borivali West\n\n* [Apartments in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Studio Apartment in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Projects in Borivali West\n\n* [New Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Borivali West\n\n* [1BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/1bhk)\n* [2BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)\n* [4BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/4bhk)\n\n### Homes by Budget in Borivali West\n\n* [Homes in Borivali West Above 5 Cr](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/budget/above-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Borivali West Between 1 Cr to 2 Cr](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-1-cr-to-2-cr)\n* [Homes in Borivali West Between 2 Cr to 5 Cr](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-2-cr-to-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Borivali West Between 50 Lakh to 1 Cr](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-50-lakh-to-1-cr)\n\n### Homes by View in Borivali West\n\n* [Open View Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property-view/open-view)\n\n### Explore Nearby Localities\n\n* [Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Dahisar East](/mumbai-dahisar.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Dahisar West](/mumbai-dahisar.west/sale/flats)\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://jannathomes.com/project/fortune-avirahi/298","title":"Fortune Avirahi Borivali West, Mumbai | Jannat Homes","raw_content":"# Fortune Avirahi\n\nBy Avirahi Group\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nStarting Price  3.70 Cr\n\nStarting Price 3.70 Cr\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/11/23//img_x_500637df40adbb122-55066607.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/11/23//img_x_500637df40adbb122-55066607.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/11/23//img_x_500637df405393441-49315488.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/11/23//img_x_500637df405393441-49315488.jpg)\n\n![Configuration](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/conf-plan.png)\n\nConfiguration   \n  3,4 BHK\n\n![Carpet Area](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/carpert-area.png)\n\nCarpet Area (Sq.ft)  \n  Start : 1192 - End : 1453\n\n![Price/Sq.ft](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/price-tag.png)\n\nPrice/Sq.ft  \n  30970.41\n\n![All in price](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/note.png)\n\nAll in one price  \n  3.70 Cr - 4.50 Cr\n\n[#### Overview](javascript:void(0);)\n\nNo of Towers\n\n1\n\nNo of Storeys\n\n18\n\nPossession Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\nPossession Date\n\nDec, 2023\n\nProject Rera No\n\nP51800004496\n\nAdvertiser Rera No\n\nA51800011711\n\n##### Introduction to Fortune Avirahi\n\nPresenting Fortune Avirahi luxury 3 & 4 bhk at Borivali West. An Iconic 21 Storey Tower With natural 100 years old private shivling temple inside the project.\n\nThe project offers great connectivity through Borivali Station, Western Express Highway and S.V. Road. Hospitals like Apex hospital and Purohit hospital, Jain temple, School & Colleges, Movie Theatre, Hotels and recreational activities in close vicinity.\n\nThe project offers lifestyle amenities, Open Air Gymnasium, Rock climbing Wall, Star Gazing Deck, Grand Entrance Lobby, Rooftop kids play Area and Barbeque pit, Business Lounge, Wireless phone , internet and video door phone facility, Health and Fitness Center with Hi-Tech Gymnasium and Back-up generator for elevators & common areas etc.\n\nThe possession date of the project is December 2023.\n\n[#### Amenities](javascript:void(0);)\n\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/20/63296e94bf3ba3-29211669.jpg)Barbeque\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05052c6e003-72578577.jpg)CCTV\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/07/63183d4b061115-66519813.jpg)Conference room\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/07/63183c02c3bac4-84599175.jpg)Elevator\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/10/13/6347e3b13b3fe7-77745629.jpg)Fire Fighting Equipment\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05077e9b612-72077823.jpg)Garden\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a9700faa70-06352851.jpg)Grand lobby\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/63107763be47b0-83341525.jpg)Intercom\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f0523d3ca665-43164855.jpg)Kids Play Area\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f050c0589627-25994027.jpg)Modular Kitchen\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/02/6311bffc67c2d9-44528578.jpg)Rain Water Harvesting\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/631076c5888133-27323167.jpg)Regular Water Supply\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a78f420df1-47241807.jpg)Rooftop garden\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/6310779b4752a9-36414246.jpg)Security\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f050680ed615-96265228.jpg)Terrace\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/20/63296f209e07e6-65554896.jpg)Video Door phone\n\n[#### Pricing, Floor Plans & Room Sizing](javascript:void(0);)\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price () | Floor Plans | Room Sizes | PDF |\n[3 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 3 BHK | 1192.00 Sq.ft | 3.70 Cr | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/projects/floor_plan/2023/01/16/b09913e989a978ea2a5e0290b22f240b.pdf) |\n[4 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 4 BHK | 1453.00 Sq.ft | 4.50 Cr | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/projects/floor_plan/2023/01/16/bfeba92cb0474ea5e4b2211cd1ef5dcb.pdf) |\n\n[#### Location](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[#### Avirahi Group](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/developer/logo/2022/11/23/637df20baf7b28-41605545.jpg)\n\n* Established In1994\n* Total Projects\n\nThe Avirahi Group, earlier known as “Abhigna Group of Companies” has been a pioneer Real Estate Development Organization for over two decades. Since its inception in 1994, Avirahi Group has taken great stride with its perseverance and hard work which has resulted in many Residential and Commercial masterpieces across Mumbai. Founder and Group Head of Avirahi Group, Virendra Shah has not only imbibed strong professional values within the group to work on each and every task with utmost perfection but also have driven the organization with excellent vision and hard work. His guidance and mentoring over the years across all divisions of the org. has resulted in strong customer relationships and emergence of Avirahi Group as a well-respected name in Real Estate Arena.\n\n[#### Brochure](javascript:void(0);)\n\