A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 3.7 Cr to 4.51 Cr\\*\n\n![Fortune Avirahi Wing A](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/55452/1612674223_e1.jpg \"Fortune Avirahi Wing A\")\n\n# Fortune Avirahi Wing A in Borivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Fortune Avirahi Wing A](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/55452/1612674223_e1.jpg \"Fortune Avirahi Wing A\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n3 ,4 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 1192 sqft - 1453 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 33 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: 1 Acres\n* Possession: June, 2022\n* Rera: P51800004496\n\n## About\n\n3.0\n\n##### Excellent\n\nFortune Avirahi Wing A is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 1 Acres, the project features 33 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 3 BHK+3T, to 4 BHK+4T Apartments ranging from 1192 sqft to 1453 sqft. The address for the project is borivali east, mumbai, maharashtra, india..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Fortune Avirahi Wing A are available in a variety of sizes. The 3 BHK+3T units start at 1192 sqft. The larger 4 BHK+4T Apartments go up to 1453 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Fortune Avirahi Wing A are designed to be accessible, with 3 BHK+3T units priced from 3.7 Cr and 4 BHK+4T Apartments from 4.51 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Fortune Constructions, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800004496 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2022-06-21, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nFortune Avirahi Wing A is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Garden. The security features include CCTV, Fire Alarm for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 1 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 33 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 1192 sqft to 1453 sqft\n* Project Address: borivali east, mumbai, maharashtra, india.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Fortune Constructions\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800004496 Units\n* Possession Start: 2022-06-21\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV, Fire Alarm\n* Sports Facilities: Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nFortune Avirahi Wing A benefits from its location in Borivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Fortune Avirahi Wing A will begin in 2022-06-21, and the project is RERA registered under P51800004496 Units. Developed by Fortune Constructions, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### 